             <h2 class="section-title">Understanding Your Grades</h2>
             <p>Grades are more than just letters; they are indicators of your understanding and progress. Our Grading & Performance calculators provide the tools you need to demystify these metrics. Calculate your GPA to see your overall standing, figure out what you need on a final exam, and understand how your performance impacts your educational goals.</p>
